{"parentUuid":"2e7a822b-7ca3-49fb-a720-d27911efa5ee","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1a5b6301-6db1-4a56-879c-185cbbd0825f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KPB8zR5NJhQB4Rik5QpDL9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# lanternfish\n2\t\n3\tThe lantern desk for the Harbour Steps night market.\n4\tStallholders borrow lanterns at dusk and bring them back at close,\n5\tand lanternfish keeps track of which lantern is with whom.\n6\t\n7\tIt is one small HTTP service with the inventory held in memory.\n8\tEvery change is written to a JSON snapshot so the inventory survives a restart.\n9\t\n10\t## Running\n11\t\n12\t```sh\n13\tgo run . -seed data/seed.json\n14\t```\n15\t\n16\tThe first start loads `data/seed.json`.\n17\tAfter that the snapshot at `data/snapshot.json` wins.\n18\t\n19\t## API\n20\t\n21\t| method | path | does |\n22\t| --- | --- | --- |\n23\t| `GET` | `/lanterns` | every lantern, sorted by id |\n24\t| `GET` | `/lanterns/{id}` | one lantern |\n25\t| `POST` | `/lanterns` | add a lantern: `{\"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"colour\": \"...\"}` |\n26\t| `POST` | `/lanterns/{id}/checkout` | lend it out: `{\"borrower\": \"...\"}` |\n27\t| `POST` | `/lanterns/{id}/return` | bring it back |\n28\t\n29\t```sh\n30\tcurl -s localhost:8086/lanterns/jade-01/checkout -d '{\"borrower\": \"Noodle stall 4\"}'\n31\t```\n32\t\n33\t## Development\n34\t\n35\t```sh\n36\tgo test ./...\n37\t```\n38\t"}]},"uuid":"1080286f-a987-4d75-9594-ef72cd702b47","timestamp":"2026-10-09T20:08:36.240Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/demo/src/lanternfish/README.md","content":"# lanternfish\n\nThe lantern desk for the Harbour Steps night market.\nStallholders borrow lanterns at dusk and bring them back at close,\nand lanternfish keeps track of which lantern is with whom.\n\nIt is one small HTTP service with the inventory held in memory.\nEvery change is written to a JSON snapshot so the inventory survives a restart.\n\n## Running\n\n```sh\ngo run . -seed data/seed.json\n```\n\nThe first start loads `data/seed.json`.\nAfter that the snapshot at `data/snapshot.json` wins.\n\n## API\n\n| method | path | does |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `GET` | `/lanterns` | every lantern, sorted by id |\n| `GET` | `/lanterns/{id}` | one lantern |\n| `POST` | `/lanterns` | add a lantern: `{\"id\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\", \"colour\": \"...\"}` |\n| `POST` | `/lanterns/{id}/checkout` | lend it out: `{\"borrower\": \"...\"}` |\n| `POST` | `/lanterns/{id}/return` | bring it back |\n\n```sh\ncurl -s localhost:8086/lanterns/jade-01/checkout -d '{\"borrower\": \"Noodle stall 4\"}'\n```\n\n## Development\n\n```sh\ngo test ./...\n```\n","numLines":38,"startLine":1,"totalLines":38}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2e7a822b-7ca3-49fb-a720-d27911efa5ee","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-cli","cwd":"/home/demo/src/lanternfish","sessionId":"2f683709-2b15-466d-ac1b-2c62fe59f4cb","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
